<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτρεμ-ᾰς</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without trembling, without
				motion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἑσταότα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.438
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμοὶ δ᾽ ὡς εἰ κέρα ἕστασαν ἠὲ
					σίδηρος ἀ. ἐν βλεφάροισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.212
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εὕδειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.352
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.92
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἧσο</span> sit <i>still!</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.200
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν</span> to keep
				<i>quiet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἶχον τὸ στρατόπεδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.53
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφέας αὐτούς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				54
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἴθι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					149
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχ᾽ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1200
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἅπτεσθαί τινος</span>”
				<i>gently, softly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1358
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βαδίζειν,</span> opp.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταχύ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				37.55
			</span></i>.</div>
